sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant API as blog.admin_service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant W as apps/worker
    participant IN as api.indexnow.org

    A->>API: publish / archive
    API->>DB: status + blog_indexnow_pings (same txn)
    API->>DB: pg_notify blog_indexnow_queue
    API-->>A: 200 (IndexNow not awaited)
    DB-->>W: NOTIFY
    alt ENVIRONMENT=prod
        W->>IN: POST urlList (yupay.uz article + /blog)
        IN-->>W: 200 / 202
        W->>DB: status=done
    else
        W->>DB: status=skipped
    end
